    "content": "# coreblow chat\n\nNo standalone `coreblow chat` command is exposed by the current CLI.\n\nUse `coreblow agent` for an agent turn or `coreblow tui` for the terminal UI.\n\n## Current Reference\n\n- [CLI guide](/cli)\n- [CLI commands reference](/cli/commands)"
